        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "4577eee1-acaa-58eb-a9f3-929a8cc04737",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Heath Ledger, Ang Lee, Diana Ossana, James Schamus, Larry McMurtry, the Joker\n- Works: Brokeback Mountain, The Dark Knight\n- Topics: film production, screenwriting, acting, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Heath Ledger was an Australian actor and director who was born on 4 April 1979 and died on 22 January 2008.\n- Brokeback Mountain is a 2005 American neo-western romantic drama film directed by Ang Lee and produced by Diana Ossana and James Schamus.\n- Larry McMurtry and cowriter Diana Ossana adapted the screenplay for Brokeback Mountain.\n- Brokeback Mountain received eight Academy Award nominations and won three awards, including Best Adapted Screenplay for Larry McMurtry and Diana Ossana.\n- Heath Ledger portrayed the Joker in The Dark Knight.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
